  "limitations": [
    "No method is automatically declared best or averaged into a biological truth. RCTD, cell2location, Stereoscope, SPOTlight, CARD and SpatialDWLS estimate reference-defined mixtures with different spatial and noise assumptions. DestVI is intended when within-cell-type continuous state matters but assumes one state per declared type per spot and is GPU-favored. Tangram learns a cell- or cluster-to-location mapping probability rather than a compositional count model. Deep-learning and R backends require isolated compatible runtimes. Cross-condition inference remains at the biological-sample level."
  ],
